B.P0=new A.cN("Blacksmith",B.Xh)
B.Zl=s(["My name is Mateo. I found you washed ashore, but I have no idea how long you have been there.","You were stabbed in the side, and your lungs were full of water. I cannot believe you are alive. I did what I could, but you need rest."],t.s)
B.Og=new A.cv("Thank him","intro_player_thanks_mateo",!0,!1)
B.WJ=s([B.Og],t.u)
B.Py=new A.ci(B.am,B.Zl,null,null,null,B.WJ)
B.Z8=s([B.Py],t.J)
B.P1=new A.cN("Mateo",B.Z8)
B.VT=s(["Britain rises on the horizon.","Behind you, the ships of your fleet cut through the waves in battle formation. Every sail is set toward the kingdom that cast you into the sea.","The king and prince who tried to erase you wait beyond those shores. At last, you have returned to face them.","This is no raid for gold. Before this day is over, the fate of Britain will be decided."],t.s)
